      '<li><span><b>Get paid.</b> Reminders go on working days only. The final notice never goes without you.</span></li>' +
      '<li><span><b>Back up.</b> Save a back-up after every invoice. It is one file; keep it in your email or Drive.</span></li></ol></div>' +
      '<div class="card"><h3>Lost your phone?</h3><p class="muted">1. Install the app on the new phone and tap Restore from file in Set-up, Back-up, using your last back-up. 2. Your sending keys are not in the back-up: log in to Twilio, Resend and Stripe on a computer, delete the old keys and make new ones, then type them into Set-up. 3. Change the relay token on your relay. 4. If you had a PIN, nobody can open the app on the lost phone without it.</p></div>' +
      '<div class="card"><h3>Moving to a new phone</h3><p class="muted">On the old phone: Set-up, Back-up, tick "Include keys", Save back-up, and send the file to yourself. On the new phone: install the app, Set-up, Restore from file. Then untick "Include keys". Delete the back-up file from your messages afterwards; it holds your keys.</p></div>' +
      '<div class="card"><h3>Where your data lives</h3><p class="muted">On this phone. Nothing is uploaded except the texts and emails you send, which go through your own Twilio, Resend and relay accounts, and card links through your own Stripe. Clearing the browser data wipes the app, so keep a back-up.</p></div>';
